  "notes": "selfoss RSS reader. Main area has a faint diagonal crosshatch pattern background; items are light-grey rows separated by thin gaps with a teal left border on unread items; read items render titles in grey. Every item carries a tiny colored favicon-like source initial square and brightly saturated, 4px-radius tag chips whose colors match the sidebar tag swatches. Some items show a 500px-wide thumbnail. Sidebar is near-black with a teal right edge; bottom has refresh and cloud/settings icon buttons. Clicking an item expands it inline with an action toolbar (Unstar, Mark as read, Open, share icons). Tag chips are also label badges."
